# Generated benchmark outputs and temporary reports.
# Curated, version-controlled inputs live under agent-benchmark/data/;
# everything below is scratch produced by CLI runs and must not be committed.
# The project lives in a subdirectory, so these patterns are anchored to
# agent-benchmark/. Keep the anchors: an unanchored `questions/` or `answers/`
# would also match a same-named directory in an evaluation-content checkout
# placed inside this tree.
/agent-benchmark/results/
/agent-benchmark/reports/
/agent-benchmark/dashboard.json
/agent-benchmark/jobs.json
/agent-benchmark/cr.md
/agent-benchmark/agent-quality-report/
/agent-benchmark/context7_comparison_results.json
*.log
*.tar.gz

# Default CLI output locations (answers.py, evaluate.py, questions.py,
# personas.py and run.py write here when --output is not given).
/agent-benchmark/answers/
/agent-benchmark/eval/
/agent-benchmark/questions/
/agent-benchmark/personas/
/agent-benchmark/baselines/

# Downloaded/generated external content
.cache/
vendor_docs/
node_modules/

# Python packaging build metadata
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Working notes / scratch planning (not for commit)
/change_plan.md
